---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../../config/site.config";

const jsonLd = [
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Article",
    headline: "Pixel Lineage Codes Not Working: 4 Verified Fixes",
    description: "Fix Pixel Lineage promo codes not working errors: group verification delay, exact case sensitivity, goblin merchant location, and expired code checks.",
    url: `${siteConfig.siteUrl}/codes/not-working/`,
    publisher: {
      "@type": "Organization",
      name: siteConfig.siteName,
      url: siteConfig.siteUrl,
    },
  },
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    itemListElement: [
      { "@type": "ListItem", position: 1, name: "Home", item: siteConfig.siteUrl },
      { "@type": "ListItem", position: 2, name: "Codes", item: `${siteConfig.siteUrl}/codes/` },
      { "@type": "ListItem", position: 3, name: "Troubleshooting", item: `${siteConfig.siteUrl}/codes/not-working/` },
    ],
  },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Pixel Lineage Codes Not Working: 4 Fixes"
  description="Fix Pixel Lineage promo codes not working errors: group verification delay, exact case sensitivity, goblin merchant location, and expired code checks."
  canonical="/codes/not-working/"
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px;">
    <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumbs" style="margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted);">
      <a href="/" style="color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none;">Home</a>
      <span class="separator" style="margin: 0 8px;">/</span>
      <a href="/codes/" style="color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none;">Codes</a>
      <span class="separator" style="margin: 0 8px;">/</span>
      <span class="current">Troubleshooting</span>
    </nav>

    <header style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
      <h1 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 2.2rem; color: var(--ink); margin: 0 0 12px;">
        Pixel Lineage Codes Not Working Fixes
      </h1>
      <p style="color: var(--muted); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
        Encountering "Invalid Code" or "Prerequisites Not Met" in Pixel Lineage? Follow this four-step empirical checklist to redeem your rewards successfully.
      </p>
    </header>

    <article style="line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ink);">
      <section style="background: #161022; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-left: 4px solid #f43f5e; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 32px;">
        <h2 style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 1.2rem; color: #f43f5e;">Most Common Culprit: Roblox Group API Cache Delay</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">
          The #1 reason codes fail in Pixel Lineage is Roblox API caching. When you join Group <strong>362755399</strong>, existing live game servers take up to 2 minutes to recognize your new membership status. Rejoining a fresh server instantly forces a re-check.
        </p>
      </section>

      <h2 style="font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--ink); margin: 32px 0 16px;">The 4 Essential Troubleshooting Steps</h2>

      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 36px;">
        <div style="background: #161022; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px;">
          <h3 style="color: #34d399; margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 1.15rem;">1. Verify All 3 Mandatory Prerequisites</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 0.95rem;">
            Unlike standard Roblox games where codes work out of the box, Pixel Lineage locks the redemption gate behind three separate account actions:
          </p>
          <ul style="color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; padding-left: 20px; margin: 0;">
            <li><strong>Join Group:</strong> Must be an active member of the <code>Pixel Lineage</code> group (ID: <code>362755399</code>).</li>
            <li><strong>Like (Thumbs Up):</strong> Give a positive vote on the official experience page.</li>
            <li><strong>Favorite:</strong> Click the Star icon on the game page.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div style="background: #161022; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px;">
          <h3 style="color: #34d399; margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 1.15rem;">2. Server Reconnection Protocol</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--muted); margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;">
            If you completed the three steps while already inside a game session, the local client will keep displaying an error. Disconnect, close the Roblox player, wait 30 seconds, and rejoin. Your group membership will be retrieved on new server handshake.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="background: #161022; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px;">
          <h3 style="color: #34d399; margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 1.15rem;">3. Strict Case Sensitivity & Whitespace Stripping</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--muted); margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;">
            All Pixel Lineage codes are strictly uppercase. Typing <code style="color: #f43f5e;">october</code> or <code style="color: #f43f5e;">October</code> will fail. Ensure there are no accidental trailing spaces when copying from mobile clipboards: enter exact code <code style="color: #34d399; font-weight: 700;">OCTOBER</code>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="background: #161022; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px;">
          <h3 style="color: #34d399; margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 1.15rem;">4. Distinguish Expired Codes From System Bugs</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--muted); margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;">
            Codes such as <code style="color: #f43f5e;">RELEASE</code> and <code style="color: #f43f5e;">LINEAGE</code> expired during earlier weekly patch migrations. Always verify against our live <a href="/codes/" style="color: var(--accent);">Active Codes Ledger</a> before assuming your client is bugged.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Evidence Dossier -->
      <section style="background: #1d152c; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 32px;">
        <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #c9a227; text-transform: uppercase;">Evidence Dossier: Group Membership Verification</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 10px;">
          Developer group identification: Group Name: <code>Pixel Lineage</code> | Owner Group ID: <code>362755399</code>.
        </p>
        <p style="color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin: 0;">
          Direct group verification endpoint: <code>https://groups.roblox.com/v1/groups/362755399</code>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 32px;">
        <a href="/codes/redeem/" style="background: #34d399; color: #0d0a14; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;">
          Go to Step-by-Step Redeem Guide →
        </a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
